From d1ae8db8048a31e7509c595240c932c171522bb5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:26:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Preserve remote notice recovery across transaction
 failures

Defer ended-turn receipt retirement until the successor reservation commits. Do not rewrite or release a passive receipt already recovered from the transcript. RED: rollback retry returned skip; failed redundant append removed the delivered receipt. GREEN: rehome suite including unknown and minimum alias observation ages; code health passes.
---
